const CinePage MARTYR_INTRO[16] = {
  {"NARRATOR", "Ten vaults opened. Ten ancient hoarders fell. The last seal shatters... and the world holds its breath.", 1, 0},
  {"NARRATOR", "In your hands, the Martyr's Arcane Time Machine begins to hum. Its sand has been falling for ten thousand years.", 1, 0},
  {"NARRATOR", "Then the sand stops.", 2, 1},
  {"THE MARTYR", "So. The last of the Hoarders is beaten.", 3, 0},
  {"THE MARTYR", "I felt every seal break. Each one was a thread of my own life, pulled tight for ten thousand years... and finally cut.", 3, 0},
  {"THE MARTYR", "Do not be afraid, child. I am the one the legends say died sealing the Hoarders away.", 3, 0},
  {"THE MARTYR", "The legends are half right. The world believed I gave my life to bind them. In truth, I bound them... and then I bound myself.", 3, 0},
  {"THE MARTYR", "No mortal body can hold that much magic and live. So I tore myself out of the flow of time, one heartbeat folded inside this hourglass. I did not die. I became the sand.", 3, 0},
  {"THE MARTYR", "I could never step out. Had I stayed human, the power I carried would have burned me to ash before the first century ended. So I waited, inside the artifact, until someone worthy broke the last seal.", 3, 0},
  {"THE MARTYR", "You fought well. You and that tank. You saved the universe. Peace has returned to the people, and their sanctuary stands. Because of you.", 3, 0},
  {"THE MARTYR", "Tell me... that rusted tank you started with. The five hulls, the five shells. Did you ever wonder where they came from?", 3, 0},
  {"THE MARTYR", "Spoils of the first crisis. I handed them down myself, parent to child, for a thousand generations, until they reached you. Old rusty heirlooms.", 3, 0},
  {"THE MARTYR", "I am your many-times-great-grandfather. Everything you are, I set in motion.", 3, 1},
  {"THE MARTYR", "So there is only one thing left to ask of a living legend. Duel me.", 4, 0},
  {"THE MARTYR", "Not for the universe. For the truth. Are you stronger than the one who saved it before you?", 4, 0},
  {"THE MARTYR", "Hold nothing back. I will not.", 4, 1},
};
